  <diagram name="Fluxo de deploy" id="oficina-c4-deploy-flow"><mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1050" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="f1" value='&lt;b style="font-size:26px"&gt;Fluxo de deploy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:14px;color:#475569"&gt;Do push na main até a API no EKS. CI e CD são workflows do GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/ci.yml e cd.yml); o Terraform e os Secrets do cluster são feitos à mão, uma vez por ambiente.&lt;/div&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="15" width="1800" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f2" value='&lt;b style="font-size:15px"&gt;GitHub&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style="font-size:11px"&gt;- Repositório e workflows&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="100" width="1100" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f3" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;Repositório GitHub&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Software System]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;push na main ou pull request&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#8C8496;strokeColor=#736782;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f4" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;GitHub Actions: CI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Container]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;ESLint, Prisma validate + migrations, build, testes unitários (cobertura 80%) e E2E, build da imagem (sem push)&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#23A2D9;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="140" width="330" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f5" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;GitHub Actions: CD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Container]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;dispara sozinho quando o CI conclui com sucesso na main (workflow_run)&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#23A2D9;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="140" width="330" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f6" value="dispara" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f3" target="f4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f7" value="CI verde" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f4" target="f5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f8" value='&lt;b style="font-size:15px"&gt;Pipeline CD (cd.yml): job deploy&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style="font-size:11px"&gt;- Passos em ordem; falha em qualquer um interrompe o deploy&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="280" width="1860" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f9" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;1. Autentica na AWS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Step]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;OIDC: assume a role oficina-fiap-github-actions, sem chave fixa&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4EB6E4;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="240" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f10" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;2. Imagens no ECR&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Step]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;Login no ECR; build e push de api, migrator e seeder com a tag = SHA do commit&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4EB6E4;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="302" y="330" width="240" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f11" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;3. Kubeconfig e overlays&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Step]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;aws eks update-kubeconfig; renderiza k8s/overlays/eks (conta, região, SHA)&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4EB6E4;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="564" y="330" width="240" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f12" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;4. Banco&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Step]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;Job oficina-db-setup: migrate e depois seed; o pipeline aguarda concluir&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4EB6E4;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="826" y="330" width="240" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f13" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;5. API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Step]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;kubectl apply -k do overlay da API (Deployment, Service, HPA, ConfigMap)&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4EB6E4;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1088" y="330" width="240" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f14" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;6. Endereço público&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Step]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;Lê o hostname do NLB; se mudou, atualiza PUBLIC_API_URL no ConfigMap e reinicia o Deployment&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4EB6E4;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="330" width="240" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f15" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;7. Verificação&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Step]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;rollout status: espera os Pods ficarem Ready (readiness probe em /health)&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4EB6E4;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1612" y="330" width="240" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f16" value="inicia" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f5" target="f9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="925" y="265"/><mxPoint x="160" y="265"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f17" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f9" target="f10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f18" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f10" target="f11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f19" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f11" target="f12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f20" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f12" target="f13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f21" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f13" target="f14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f22" value="" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f14" target="f15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f23" value='&lt;b style="font-size:15px"&gt;AWS (us-east-1)&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style="font-size:11px"&gt;- Recursos criados pelo Terraform&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="480" width="1860" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f24" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;IAM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Infrastructure Node]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;role oficina-fiap-github-actions (confia só neste repositório, branch main)&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4387BF;strokeColor=#245984;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="530" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f25" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;Amazon ECR&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Infrastructure Node]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;oficina-api, oficina-migrator, oficina-seeder&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4387BF;strokeColor=#245984;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="302" y="530" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f26" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;RDS PostgreSQL 16&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Container: Database]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;recebe migrations e o seed do admin&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4387BF;strokeColor=#245984;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="826" y="530" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f27" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;EKS oficina-fiap-eks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Infrastructure Node]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;namespace oficina: Deployment (2 a 4 Pods), Service, HPA&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4387BF;strokeColor=#245984;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1088" y="530" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f28" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;Network Load Balancer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Infrastructure Node]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;criado pelo Service; URL pública da API em /api/v1&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4387BF;strokeColor=#245984;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="530" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f29" value="OIDC" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f9" target="f24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f30" value="push" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f10" target="f25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f31" value="migrate + seed" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f12" target="f26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f32" value="kubectl apply" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f13" target="f27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f33" value="lê o hostname" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f14" target="f28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f34" value="pull das imagens (SHA)" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f25" target="f27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="422" y="655"/><mxPoint x="1208" y="655"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f35" value='&lt;b style="font-size:15px"&gt;Preparação manual (fora do pipeline)&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style="font-size:11px"&gt;- Feita uma vez por ambiente&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="700" width="1860" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f36" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;Terraform&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Component]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;infra/bootstrap (bucket do state) e infra: plan e apply à mão&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4EB6E4;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="750" width="280" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f37" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;S3 state&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Infrastructure Node]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;Estado remoto, compartilhado pelo grupo&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4387BF;strokeColor=#245984;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="370" y="750" width="240" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f38" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;Infraestrutura AWS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Deployment Node]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;VPC, EKS, RDS, ECR e role OIDC&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#8C8496;strokeColor=#736782;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="750" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f39" value="grava state" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f36" target="f37"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f40" value="descreve" style="endArrow=blockThin;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64748B;endSize=12;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f37" target="f38"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f41" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;Secrets do cluster&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[kubectl]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;oficina-api-secrets (DATABASE_URL do RDS, JWT, Stripe, SMTP) e oficina-seed-secrets (admin). O CD não cria Secrets.&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#23A2D9;strokeColor=#0E7DAD;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1010" y="750" width="400" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f42" value='&lt;b style="font-size:14px"&gt;Secret do GitHub&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10px"&gt;[Actions]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:11px"&gt;AWS_ROLE_ARN = ARN da role criada pelo Terraform&lt;/div&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#8C8496;strokeColor=#736782;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;metaEdit=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="750" width="390" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f43" value="&lt;b&gt;Estado atual:&lt;/b&gt; o CD está implementado e foi executado no EKS; a API respondeu 200 em /api/v1/health pelo NLB. O CD não faz teste HTTP externo: a verificação é o rollout status. O endpoint é HTTP." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="925" width="1850" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
